{"id":622,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"知識と探究を往復する六年間の教育","feature_description":"開智日本橋学園は、探究・知識・英語を柱とする六年間の教育を示しています。探究では自ら課題を設定し、資料を調べ、考えをまとめて発表する学びを重ねます。教科教育で基礎知識を培い、英語教育や国際バカロレア（IB）の学びも組み合わせる構成です。多様な他者との対話や協働を通じ、問いを深める力を育てます。中学段階から高校段階へ学びをつなぐ構成です。","clubs":[{"id":12994,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kng.ed.jp/faq/schoollife/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12995,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kng.ed.jp/faq/schoollife/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12996,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kng.ed.jp/faq/schoollife/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12997,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kng.ed.jp/faq/schoollife/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12998,"name":"バトン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kng.ed.jp/faq/schoollife/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":12999,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kng.ed.jp/faq/schoollife/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13000,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kng.ed.jp/faq/schoollife/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13001,"name":"軟式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kng.ed.jp/faq/schoollife/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13002,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kng.ed.jp/faq/schoollife/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13003,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kng.ed.jp/faq/schoollife/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13004,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kng.ed.jp/faq/schoollife/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13005,"name":"フットサル部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kng.ed.jp/faq/schoollife/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13006,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kng.ed.jp/faq/schoollife/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13007,"name":"サイエンス部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kng.ed.jp/faq/schoollife/","verified_at":"2026-11